WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:01.501
And Ukraine's capital, where

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.802
the mayor of Kiev

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.204
is vowing to make sure

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:06.740
bomb shelters are open at night

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.907
for those who need them.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.609
That's after three people died

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.410
during a Russian

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.312
missile attack overnight

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:13.113
when they could not

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:14.581
get into a locked shelter.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.816
Ukraine's military said it shot down

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.152
all ten missiles fired at Kiev.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.254
And that latest round of strikes.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:24.724
But falling debris killed three victims,

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.860
including a nine year old girl

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.328
and her mother.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:29.029
I want to bring in

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.430
senior international correspondent

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.364
Sam Kiley,

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.733
who is in eastern Ukraine for us.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.735
Tragically, Sam, tragically,

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:37.404
the inability to enter

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:38.204
a shelter

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.173
caused the death of 33 people,

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:42.108
including a little girl.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:46.079
How did this happen?

00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:47.747
Well, again,

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.816
it is a kind of extraordinary event

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:50.984
because

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.119
the citizens of Kiev have got so used

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.021
to coming under air attack

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:56.222
that one of the problems

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.390
for the local administration

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.291
is to get people

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.025
to go

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:00.393
into those bomb shelters

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.594
or to take shelter

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:02.762
in metro stations

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.931
or the centers of their homes.

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.567
People just ignore the sirens

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.536
or very often ignore the sirens.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:10.970
But on this occasion,

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:13.006
it would appear that

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:13.907
a significant number

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.675
of civilians gathered

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:16.509
at the doors

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.745
of this bomb shelter in Kiev,

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:20.346
banged on the doors, thought

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:23.716
that they may be in other points of entry

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:24.184
because they couldn't

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:24.984
believe

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:25.885
that it was not possible

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.221
to get into a bomb shelter.

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:30.290
And then, tragically,

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:32.158
a missile was destroyed in the sky

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:33.059
above them.

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.561
The descending debris killed

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:35.895
three people and injured others.

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:37.130
An extraordinary

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.732
series of catastrophic moments

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.434
of bad luck.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.603
Arguably, perhaps nobody would have been

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.605
at that bomb shelter been opened.

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:46.806
Now, that is, of course,

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:49.309
part of now an official investigation

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.511
by the Ukrainian authorities.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:52.378
These are bomb shelters

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.346
that have been around,

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:54.481
in fact, were built

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:55.915
during the Cold War

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:58.051
as a defensive measure against

00:01:58.551 --> 00:01:59.552
NATO's attack.

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:00.820
And ironically, of course,

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:01.721
it is Russia

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:02.555
that is attacking

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:03.456
Ukraine at a time

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.793
when Ukraine is discussing joining Naito

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:09.629
as a consequence of the Russian invasion.

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:10.096
Well, any

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:12.932
yeah.

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.802
I mean, it is an absolutely tragic story

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.270
because Ukraine said

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.639
that it intercepted all ten missiles.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:20.840
But look, we've also seen,

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:21.841
as you say,

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:22.575
an increase

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.643
in the number of attacks

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:24.811
inside of Russia.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.013
What more do we know about the group

00:02:27.514 --> 00:02:28.815
behind the attacks?

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:30.850
And I guess the question is,

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:31.951
are we looking at the beginning

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.921
of the counter offensive

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:37.357
Well, the new phase,

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:38.992
what is absolutely no doubt

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:41.194
is that what we haven't seen before

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.862
is outright attacks

00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:45.031
on Ukrainian territory.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.966
Coming from Ukrainian territory.

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:50.069
So about a week ago, we saw Russians

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:51.971
who are dissident Russians, part

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.473
of the Ukrainian

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:56.543
forces, crossing into Russian territory,

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.445
ostensibly under their own steam,

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:00.380
but take that

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.681
with a pinch of salt

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:02.515
and conducting

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:04.117
military operations inside

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.152
Russia, that the Ukrainian intelligence

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.921
said were very valuable.

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.289
They went about eight kilometers,

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:10.857
five miles inside the territory.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:12.091
Now, those two self,

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.126
same groups claim

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:14.661
that they have crossed the borders.

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:16.396
Again, the Russians are claiming

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:17.430
they have repelled them.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:18.431
We don't have any independent

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:20.633
corroboration yet one way or the other.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:23.002
But a lot of this is concurrent now

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:25.872
with ongoing shelling of Russian villages

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:27.574
from Ukrainian territory

00:03:27.574 --> 00:03:29.676
attributed obviously by the Russians

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:31.945
to the Ukrainians, causing

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:33.046
eight injuries,

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:33.980
according to the governor

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.315
of Belgorod Province.

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:37.584
And the force, well, the necessity

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.285
to evacuate civilians

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:40.920
from a number of border

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.889
villages inside Ukraine.

00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:44.057
Now, of course,

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.725
the Ukrainians have signaled adviser

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.460
to the president saying yesterday

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.461
that we could expect

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:50.597
to see more of these kind of operations

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:51.731
and indeed,

00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:53.132
the quote unquote,

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.701
mysterious drone strikes

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:56.402
that have hit Moscow

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.471
and Krasnodar oil refineries.

00:03:58.471 --> 00:03:59.973
This is the new phase

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:00.506
in the war

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:01.874
that the Ukrainians are prosecuting,

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:02.742
there's no doubt about that.

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:05.812
All right.

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:07.547
Sam Kiley, thank you so much.

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:09.415
Well, as the war in Ukraine continues,

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:12.252
so too are its efforts to join Naito.

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:14.354
The head of the bloc is underlining

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:16.422
Ukraine's part in NATO's future

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:16.990
as he meets

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.791
with foreign ministers in Oslo.

00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:19.826
At least one member

00:04:19.826 --> 00:04:20.893
needs some more

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:22.629
convincing as the German foreign

00:04:22.629 --> 00:04:24.631
minister signals skepticism.

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:25.198
That Ukraine

00:04:25.198 --> 00:04:27.267
should be allowed to join the bloc

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:28.935
while at war.

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:31.004
Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky,

00:04:31.004 --> 00:04:32.772
joining a summit in Moldova,

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:36.075
says the time is now.

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:38.344
Ukraine is ready to be in need.

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:39.345
We are waiting

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:41.447
when NATO's will be ready to host

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:43.683
and we stand to have Ukraine

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:45.318
and I think security

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:46.653
guarantees are very important,

00:04:46.653 --> 00:04:48.054
not only for Ukraine,

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:49.422
for all the neighbors, for Moldova,

00:04:49.422 --> 00:04:51.090
because of of the Russia

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.659
and of their aggression

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:54.927
in Ukraine and potential aggression for

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:56.596
that part of Europe.

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.668
Sebastian is following

00:05:01.668 --> 00:05:03.303
all these developments

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:04.771
for us from London.

00:05:04.771 --> 00:05:05.872
Great to have you on.

00:05:05.872 --> 00:05:06.606
Look, Germany,

00:05:06.606 --> 00:05:08.041
as we've heard, very hesitant

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:09.809
to allow a country currently

00:05:09.809 --> 00:05:11.778
in a war to join NATO.

00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:12.779
That's the reality.

00:05:12.779 --> 00:05:14.013
It's interesting that Jens

00:05:14.013 --> 00:05:16.449
Stoltenberg says that Ukraine will be

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:18.851
at some point joining Naito.

00:05:19.052 --> 00:05:20.286
Well, we don't know

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:22.922
when what the timeline would be.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.558
Yeah, this is about timing, Alina.

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:26.392
I think

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:28.261
in the NATO alliance as a whole,

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:30.630
probably a majority of countries would

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:33.299
would be in favor of Ukraine

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.468
eventually joining the alliance.

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:36.469
The operative word

00:05:36.469 --> 00:05:38.771
being eventually it has been clear

00:05:38.771 --> 00:05:40.306
and of course, made even clearer today

00:05:40.306 --> 00:05:41.341
by the German foreign minister

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:43.276
and the secretary general himself.

00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:43.810
But it's been clear

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:45.878
all along that they couldn't join

00:05:45.878 --> 00:05:47.580
while at war with Russia.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.681
Because, of course, of the way

00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:49.282
that NATO's

00:05:49.282 --> 00:05:51.050
structured, Article five

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.285
would mean that NATO allies

00:05:52.285 --> 00:05:53.186
would have to come to Ukraine,

00:05:53.186 --> 00:05:54.320
to Ukraine's defense,

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.021
and then we would, of course,

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:56.389
have the unthinkable.

00:05:56.389 --> 00:05:59.559
The NATO alliance at war with Russia,

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:00.326
you know,

00:06:00.326 --> 00:06:02.095
so we even just have some holdouts here.

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:03.596
The Ukrainian foreign minister,

00:06:03.596 --> 00:06:04.597
according to his spokesperson,

00:06:04.597 --> 00:06:06.232
is saying that NATO's that Ukraine's

00:06:06.232 --> 00:06:07.433
accession to NATO

00:06:07.433 --> 00:06:08.701
shouldn't even be discussed

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:09.836
at the summit in Vilnius.

00:06:09.836 --> 00:06:12.472
They have been more opposed than others.

00:06:12.505 --> 00:06:13.239
But overall,

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:15.274
I think the alliance is looking at this

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:16.142
in the long term.

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:16.776
The frustration

00:06:16.776 --> 00:06:17.944
for Ukraine

00:06:17.944 --> 00:06:19.345
is, of course, that that really

00:06:19.345 --> 00:06:21.581
has been the situation for 15 years.

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:23.082
Secretary Blinken saying today

00:06:23.082 --> 00:06:25.385
we stand by the Bucharest commitment

00:06:25.385 --> 00:06:27.587
that was made in 2008 to support

00:06:27.754 --> 00:06:29.789
Ukraine's eventual accession to NATO.

00:06:29.789 --> 00:06:30.690
So he really wants

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:32.325
some kind of interim step

00:06:32.325 --> 00:06:33.092
to bring home

00:06:33.092 --> 00:06:35.027
to his people security guarantees.

00:06:35.027 --> 00:06:37.163
You heard him say an invitation

00:06:37.163 --> 00:06:38.264
to clear invitation

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:39.832
from NATO and the same from the E.U.

00:06:39.832 --> 00:06:41.134
He wants a sort of clear

00:06:41.134 --> 00:06:42.902
path to membership

00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:44.370
there, essentially saying, look,

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:46.773
we are paying with our blood

00:06:46.773 --> 00:06:48.808
for European values, for freedom

00:06:48.808 --> 00:06:49.375
in Ukraine.

00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:51.711
If we can't get these concrete decisions,

00:06:51.878 --> 00:06:53.279
then what hope for other countries

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:58.484
Sebastian, thank you so much.

00:06:58.484 --> 00:06:59.185
Great to see you.

